waqt-e-rukhsat shahe wala se sakina ne kaha<br>
aakhri baar kaleje se lagalo baba<br>
<br>
sabr-e-sarwar ne uthaye the kayi laashe magar <br>
phat gaye qalb-o-jigar padte hi beti pe nazar <br>
jod kar haato'n ko jab bali sakina ne kaha<br>
<br>
subha se jo bhi gaya ran ko na wapas aaya <br>
shaq hai ammu ki judayi se kaleja mera <br>
is se pehle ke yateeemi ka ho sar par saaya<br>
<br>
meri taqdeer me ab phir na ujaala hoga <br>
asr ke saath yateemi ka andhera hoga <br>
aakhri naaz ye ek baba uthalo mera<br>
<br>
tashnagi aap ki shafqat ki na jeene degi <br>
jab masaeb ki ghutan saans na lene degi <br>
hoga furqat ki rasan me mera nanha sa gala<br>
<br>
khaima-e-zeest me har simt andhere honge <br>
bekasi zulm aziyyat ke basere honge <br>
hoga zindaan-e-museebat hi muqaddar mera<br>
<br>
chaah paani ki mujhe hai na ghiza ki chahat <br>
ek hi hai mere baba mere dil me hasrat <br>
apne seene pe bas ek baar sula le baba<br>
<br>
neend aati hai faqat aap ke seene pa mujhe <br>
baba batlaiye ab khaak pe sou'n kaise <br>
ab kabhi mujh ko milega na ye seena baba<br>
<br>
qaide aalaam-o-masaeb hi muqaddar hogi <br>
aap ke seene ki thandak na mayassar hogi <br>
hashr tak khaak ke bistar pa mujhe hai sona<br>
<br>
anjuman hai ye jo saqqa-e-haram se mansoob <br>
karbala ki ise yawar hai ziyarat matloob <br>
jaake ye rouza-e-sarwar pe sunaye nouha<br>
<br>
